; Add these three records in Cloudflare's DNS settings.
; Replace tokens.example.com everywhere with your website's hostname.
; Use DNS-only for these new records. Leave your existing website/Tunnel record unchanged.
; The numbered keys and the mcp protocol label are experimental and may change.
;
; This record points agents to the list of features the site provides.
_index._agents.tokens.example.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 tokens.example.com. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65400="https://tokens.example.com/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
;
; This record points agents to the instructions for connecting to the MCP server.
_mcp._agents.tokens.example.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 tokens.example.com. alpn="mcp,h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65400="https://tokens.example.com/mcp/server-card" key65402="mcp"
;
; This TXT record gives agents another way to find the same feature list.
_catalog._agents.tokens.example.com. 3600 IN TXT "url=https://tokens.example.com/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
